WEBVTT

00:22.100 --> 00:25.000
My name is Shildina,
Priestess of the Water Dragon!

00:25.910 --> 00:29.580
I have come here as the representative
of the Heavenly Emperor!

00:32.680 --> 00:35.079
Raphtalia, is that...

00:35.080 --> 00:37.390
Yes. She's the Water Dragon Priestess.

00:37.850 --> 00:40.100
Heavenly Emperor of the rebel army!

00:41.670 --> 00:47.009
The path of peace has been cut off,
and a full-scale clash is now inevitable!

00:47.010 --> 00:51.739
If battle reaches the capital,
many civilians will become victims!

00:51.740 --> 00:55.540
Surely you do not desire
such a pointless war!

00:56.060 --> 00:59.809
Therefore! Let us settle this
conflict through a duel...

00:59.810 --> 01:02.900
...between the representatives of each side!

01:04.100 --> 01:09.389
If you defeat me, the government army
will collapse and the war will end!

01:09.390 --> 01:12.649
If you wish to save the people
and bring peace to this land,

01:12.650 --> 01:15.660
then let this duel be the curtain
call of your revolution!

01:18.730 --> 01:23.169
Please wait!
You're our army's supreme commander!

01:23.170 --> 01:25.750
There is no need for you
to go forth personally!

01:26.170 --> 01:29.239
It was I who agreed to meet with
the Water Dragon Priestess.

01:29.240 --> 01:30.929
However...

01:30.930 --> 01:33.229
Lord Iwatani, we should move more—

01:33.230 --> 01:35.450
As my opponent in this duel!

01:35.890 --> 01:39.519
I want the former Water Dragon Priestess,
Sadeena, to face me!

01:39.520 --> 01:41.370
Huh? Eh?

01:41.840 --> 01:43.250
Big sister Sadeena?

01:47.000 --> 01:50.880
You've got quite an eye for
choosing me as your opponent.

01:51.300 --> 01:54.709
Please wait! We haven't even
decided to accept the duel yet!

01:54.710 --> 01:56.549
It's only one opponent.

01:56.550 --> 02:01.740
If I refuse this duel, who knows
what rumors they'll spread later.

02:02.160 --> 02:05.310
It could even affect things
after the revolution.

02:06.970 --> 02:11.359
You all know how terrifying
priestesses can be, right?

02:11.360 --> 02:15.530
If you don't want to get hurt,
just stay here and watch.

02:27.790 --> 02:32.420
I am the former Water Dragon Priestess,
Sadeena.

02:35.160 --> 02:37.680
My final wish has been granted.

02:39.430 --> 02:42.140
I will cleanse my clan's disgrace
with my own hands.

02:42.750 --> 02:44.100
Clan?

02:45.470 --> 02:46.810
I...

02:48.330 --> 02:50.320
I am your little sister!

02:50.800 --> 02:51.770
Eh?

03:00.410 --> 03:04.120
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

04:23.530 --> 04:29.870
EPISODE 11: THE ORACLE PRIESTESS

04:32.840 --> 04:34.810
Big sister Sadeena's...

04:35.630 --> 04:37.010
...little sister?

04:37.450 --> 04:41.010
I was born after you fled from Q'ten Lo.

04:41.350 --> 04:44.599
So it's only natural that you
didn't know of me. But...!

04:44.600 --> 04:48.730
Because of you, I was forcibly made to inherit
the role of Water Dragon Priestess!

04:49.420 --> 04:52.100
I see. So those people...

04:52.700 --> 04:56.790
I tried desperately to take your place...

04:57.520 --> 05:01.780
You failed? You let the criminal escape?!

05:02.500 --> 05:03.739
I'm sorry...

05:03.740 --> 05:06.370
Why can't you do what Sadeena could?!

05:08.960 --> 05:11.580
Father... Mother...

05:12.560 --> 05:15.109
It seems she can't be
a replacement for Sadeena.

05:15.110 --> 05:18.050
So there's a huge difference
between sisters.

05:18.400 --> 05:21.260
A useless priestess is worthless to our clan!

05:23.090 --> 05:26.170
I'm sorry...

05:27.960 --> 05:32.020
Do you know what kind of hell
I've been through...

05:47.730 --> 05:49.659
...by inheriting the title of priestess?

05:49.660 --> 05:51.569
Of course you wouldn't!

05:51.570 --> 05:53.579
You abandoned both
your country and your clan

05:53.580 --> 05:57.999
and even became a traitor who raises her
sword against the Heavenly Emperor!

05:58.000 --> 06:02.470
Former priestess Sadeena!
I shall deliver judgment upon you!

06:11.060 --> 06:13.369
Why are you not taking beast form?

06:13.370 --> 06:16.020
Do you think you can defeat me
without fighting seriously?

06:19.230 --> 06:23.320
Wind God, become the power to defend me
and blow away my enemies!

06:23.670 --> 06:26.760
Drifa Wind God Armor!

06:31.340 --> 06:33.350
Then I'll fight until I cut you down!

06:42.300 --> 06:43.380
Fight me!

06:43.840 --> 06:45.720
Are you mocking me?!

06:46.420 --> 06:47.970
Big sister Sadeena!

06:52.200 --> 06:54.420
Not even a twitch of her brow...

06:55.840 --> 07:00.020
It's my fault you've been driven this far.

07:00.450 --> 07:02.840
I've made you suffer all this time.

07:20.050 --> 07:21.340
You sure?

07:24.920 --> 07:28.390
If I don't win under the same conditions,
it would tarnish the name of priestess.

07:28.770 --> 07:33.040
This is the legendary phantom sake,
Sakamata's daiginjo!

07:35.230 --> 07:38.650
It feels like such a waste to drink it!
Can I take it home?

07:38.980 --> 07:41.709
Looks like the drinking contest has begun.

07:41.710 --> 07:44.649
This doesn't even feel like
a duel anymore.

07:44.650 --> 07:47.800
Is that a juice? Filo wants some too!

07:52.220 --> 07:55.500
Who'd have thought we'd
ever get to drink together?

07:56.030 --> 07:59.250
If you want, we can even settle this
with a drinking contest.

08:01.800 --> 08:06.470
They forced you to become
a perfect priestess, didn't they?

08:08.230 --> 08:10.639
Failure isn't allowed in your duty,

08:10.640 --> 08:13.660
and you even have to execute
someone you don't even hate.

08:14.640 --> 08:18.560
Forcing my little sister to take over
what I used to do...

08:20.580 --> 08:24.400
If you hate it, the best thing is to quit.
I'll help you.

08:26.450 --> 08:27.670
Don't mock me!

08:28.000 --> 08:31.409
Do you know what I went through
because you ran away?!

08:31.410 --> 08:36.089
That's exactly why we have to end
our clan's cursed traditions!

08:36.090 --> 08:40.550
So no more unfortunate priestesses
like you or me will ever be born!

08:45.600 --> 08:46.560
That's...

08:47.550 --> 08:51.570
Yes. The harpoon you left
behind in Q'ten Lo.

08:53.660 --> 08:55.310
Could it be the oracle?!

09:03.400 --> 09:08.360
A priestess is one who devotes her very life
to protecting the Heavenly Emperor.

09:17.630 --> 09:22.249
I was born into this world
to become a priestess.

09:22.250 --> 09:23.460
Therefore!

09:23.960 --> 09:26.920
I shall fulfill my duty to the very end!

09:33.150 --> 09:34.300
What's wrong?

09:34.750 --> 09:39.429
Um, something soft and floaty
came out of that harpoon

09:39.430 --> 09:42.060
and went into big sis' body.

09:46.980 --> 09:49.559
Drifa Lightning Speed!

09:49.560 --> 09:51.640
Thunder Guard!

10:04.920 --> 10:06.800
Sadeena's magic?!

10:07.580 --> 10:11.069
The power to transfer the will or memories
dwelling within an object onto a card,

10:11.070 --> 10:13.830
then recreate them in times of need.

10:14.450 --> 10:17.100
So that's what an oracle is.

10:41.710 --> 10:46.040
I'll kill you without making you suffer
with the Heavenly Emperor's mercy!

10:48.160 --> 10:52.510
Too bad, but I can't let
myself be killed here!

10:56.050 --> 11:02.370
These shoulders bear the fate
of Heavenly Emperor and Q'ten Lo!

11:05.940 --> 11:09.080
Just like how you have people
you'd risk your life to protect,

11:09.570 --> 11:12.320
I have people I want to protect too!

11:19.030 --> 11:21.540
I can't afford to lose either.

11:21.920 --> 11:24.410
Especially for the sake
of my suffering little sister!

11:24.800 --> 11:26.670
Wave Form Dragon Strike!

11:33.380 --> 11:35.010
Thunder God!

11:42.510 --> 11:44.520
Thunder God?!

11:44.900 --> 11:47.730
She cast it without Master Naofumi's support?

11:52.690 --> 11:54.080
Why...

11:54.600 --> 11:57.860
After leaving this country,
I became stronger.

11:58.760 --> 12:02.869
You can't defeat me by just
copying my old techniques.

12:02.870 --> 12:06.910
Not yet... I haven't lost yet...!

12:08.870 --> 12:10.580
Lucor Fruit?

12:11.790 --> 12:14.070
Don't tell me...

12:23.210 --> 12:26.290
Zodia... So it really was her.

12:26.740 --> 12:28.520
But why did she blow herself up?

12:48.540 --> 12:55.960
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

13:07.740 --> 13:09.180
That tail...

13:09.600 --> 13:11.250
Just like big sister Raphtalia's.

13:13.860 --> 13:17.070
I'm overflowing with power, heh.

13:17.370 --> 13:18.530
"Heh?"

13:20.720 --> 13:22.040
I see.

13:22.850 --> 13:25.990
So that form is your trump card.

13:26.350 --> 13:28.619
Come at me anytime, heh.

13:28.620 --> 13:31.330
You're awfully confident, aren't you!

13:40.160 --> 13:42.800
The density of your magic is on
a whole different level now.

13:52.360 --> 13:53.770
Illusion magic?

14:07.790 --> 14:10.410
Drifa Thunder Burst!

14:18.300 --> 14:20.630
Five Practices Destiny Split!

14:37.940 --> 14:39.900
Earth defeats water, heh!

14:45.530 --> 14:47.199
Big sister Sadeena!

14:47.200 --> 14:47.990
Sadeena!

14:49.700 --> 14:51.160
Are you okay?

14:55.730 --> 15:00.210
If you can fight this hard,
then you pass the test, heh.

15:00.710 --> 15:03.480
Sadeena can't even put up a fight...

15:03.920 --> 15:06.890
Just what has she summoned before?

15:10.640 --> 15:15.349
I'm so happy that Naofumi
is worried about me.

15:15.350 --> 15:17.469
Hey, don't cling to me!

15:17.470 --> 15:20.980
Oh, come on. We don't get
moments like this often.

15:27.200 --> 15:30.190
My consciousness...

15:34.480 --> 15:37.020
Naofumi-chan?

15:37.620 --> 15:39.279
Why are you here?

15:39.280 --> 15:42.380
I've been here this whole time,
and you didn't notice?

15:42.710 --> 15:43.910
Yes...

15:44.880 --> 15:48.340
Ah, maybe it's because
I drank a lot of sake?

15:49.240 --> 15:51.780
So you were completely drunk.

15:53.690 --> 15:57.089
If you're with the rebel army's
Heavenly Emperor,

15:57.090 --> 16:00.149
does that mean you're a holder
of a spirit weapon?

16:00.150 --> 16:03.230
Yeah. I'm the Shield Hero.

16:04.010 --> 16:07.240
Shield Hero...

16:07.780 --> 16:12.589
Shildina, have you taken
a liking to Naofumi too?

16:12.590 --> 16:15.539
Naofumi-chan, are you Sadeena's lover?!

16:15.540 --> 16:17.309
Of course not.

16:17.310 --> 16:18.250
Then...

16:25.170 --> 16:26.589
Shildina?!

16:26.590 --> 16:27.420
What's wrong?!

16:29.380 --> 16:33.809
There's a huge hole in her chest,

16:33.810 --> 16:36.600
and something greater
is trying to get in.

16:37.160 --> 16:39.940
Could the oracle's power
be going out of control?

16:43.320 --> 16:44.349
Raphtalia!

16:44.350 --> 16:46.440
Everyone, get back!

16:48.650 --> 16:51.110
Spirit Blade: Soul Slice!

17:11.430 --> 17:14.050
My body's finally stabilized, heh.

17:18.010 --> 17:20.080
Bearer of a spirit weapon,

17:20.640 --> 17:23.610
one who will become
the new Heavenly Emperor,

17:24.040 --> 17:26.569
the former Dragon Water Priestess,

17:26.570 --> 17:29.110
and a foreign sacred bird.

17:31.570 --> 17:33.490
The time has come.

17:34.110 --> 17:36.500
This is the perfect chance to crush her.

17:39.910 --> 17:42.169
Wait! Just who are you...?!

17:42.170 --> 17:44.250
We'll meet again, heh.

17:48.090 --> 17:51.050
She flew?! An application of wind magic?

17:55.510 --> 17:58.970
She can fly? Filo wants to fly too!

18:07.730 --> 18:13.060
Master, Raph-chan says she can hear
something coming from your pocket.

18:14.160 --> 18:17.730
She says she hears it calling
for help from that card.

18:20.830 --> 18:24.960
The soul of that big sister is inside it.

18:29.220 --> 18:31.840
To entrust something
so important to me...

18:32.270 --> 18:34.949
She flew off in the direction
of the capital, right?

18:34.950 --> 18:35.889
Yeah, that's right.

18:35.890 --> 18:36.849
Raluva!

18:36.850 --> 18:38.060
Yes!

18:38.450 --> 18:40.520
We're heading for the capital.

18:41.380 --> 18:44.639
If anything happens, send a messenger.
Until then, don't make a move.

18:44.640 --> 18:47.649
But the government army's
forces are in the capital!

18:47.650 --> 18:49.860
We'll be fine.

18:52.570 --> 18:53.579
Filo.

18:53.580 --> 18:55.300
Aye!

18:56.820 --> 18:57.910
Sadeena.

18:59.440 --> 19:02.450
Let's go save your other little sister.

19:04.990 --> 19:08.430
Thank you, Naofumi.

19:25.020 --> 19:29.979
She can't even slow them down?
What a completely useless priestess.

19:29.980 --> 19:32.949
Move all the treasures
out of the storehouse!

19:32.950 --> 19:34.110
Roger!

19:38.300 --> 19:40.190
Lady Makina, this way.

19:40.830 --> 19:43.249
What shall we do about
the Heavenly Emperor?

19:43.250 --> 19:47.079
That brat's just in the way.
Leave him be.

19:47.080 --> 19:51.180
He's the Heavenly Emperor, so he can
take responsibility and die—

20:07.310 --> 20:10.159
Sadeena, do you know
where the Heavenly Emperor is?

20:10.160 --> 20:13.230
The castle keep. There's a Chamber
of the Heavenly Emperor there.

20:16.110 --> 20:17.589
What's wrong?

20:17.590 --> 20:18.490
Look!

20:25.020 --> 20:26.349
Master Naofumi...

20:26.350 --> 20:27.660
We must hurry.

20:54.100 --> 20:55.650
What a disaster...

20:56.110 --> 20:57.990
Help me!

20:58.610 --> 21:01.359
Hey, what happened here?

21:01.360 --> 21:05.680
All of a sudden, that person
appeared from the castle...

21:06.320 --> 21:07.640
That person?

21:14.090 --> 21:15.689
She'll kill us!

21:15.690 --> 21:19.010
Someone help us!

21:22.330 --> 21:24.140
Hey! Stay with me!

21:31.120 --> 21:33.150
It's her, Master Naofumi.

21:47.940 --> 21:49.840
Master Naofumi! There!

23:36.230 --> 23:41.060
#12 THE RETURN OF THE HEAVENLY EMPEROR
